  "notes": "Cash basis. Governmental statement rolls cash basis fund balances (161,606 beginning, restated -128, ending 150,825); fund balance fields used; beginning cash not printed separately; ending cash = cash + county treasurer cash on the governmental funds statement of assets (p3). Interest income printed under Other Financing Sources below total receipts (outside_printed_total). Business-type from the cash-basis proprietary statement (p6); interest, bond proceeds (business_type.debt_proceeds), debt service and capital outlay printed under Other Receipts (Disbursements) below the totals. The Statement of Activities nets the 407,845 bond proceeds against Water expenses (1,346,076). Balance sheet from the governmental funds statement (totals equal government-wide 150,825) and proprietary funds statement; totals from the Statement of Net Position Total column (p1). Detail: only supplementary schedule is the combined all-funds budgetary schedule (p9), so detail is one line per fund column of the governmental and proprietary statements. Several 1-dollar rounding differences in the printed report recorded in report_discrepancies. Read pages 1-9 of 9"
